.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-ATTEST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-attest \- Register and manage attested session bindings
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu attest\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Register and manage attested session bindings
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-attest\-register(1)
Register a session binding for attested writes
.TP
quipu\-attest\-list(1)
List registered session bindings
.TP
quipu\-attest\-allow\-write(1)
Allow a session to write
.TP
quipu\-attest\-deny\-write(1)
Stop a session from writing
.TP
quipu\-attest\-require\-v2(1)
Require write\-v2 signatures for a session
.TP
quipu\-attest\-allow\-v1(1)
Allow write\-v1 signatures for a session again
.TP
quipu\-attest\-revoke(1)
Revoke a session binding
.TP
quipu\-attest\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
